{
  "dom_id": "step-132262",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying Surds: Square Roots of Integers",
  "problem": "Which of the following numbers are surds?\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2},\\qquad \\sqrt{8},\\qquad \\sqrt{16}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "A surd is a number containing a radical symbol $\\sqrt{\\phantom{0}}$ that cannot be written as a positive or negative whole number or fraction.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each number in turn.\n\n- $\\sqrt{2}$ is a surd. Using a calculator, we find that $\\sqrt{2}=1.414\\,213\\,562\\,...$\n\n- $\\sqrt{8}$ is a surd. Using a calculator, we find that $\\sqrt{8}=2.828\\,427\\,124\\,...$\n\n- $\\sqrt{16}$ is **NOT** a surd. Since $16$ is a perfect square, we can get rid of the square root symbol ($\\sqrt{\\phantom{x}}$) and obtain a whole number:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16}=\\sqrt{4^2}=4\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is: $\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\sqrt{8}$ only.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-132262\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"132262\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12828\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-132262\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">Identifying Surds: Square Roots of Integers</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"132262\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                   